{"4374470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Speedland", "steam_appid": 4374470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast plains, mountains, forests, lakes and valleys, complete quests, find treasures and rare items, and participate in races to earn cash and acquire a home in your town. Build and research, develop your town by improving your finances, technology, and cars, and stand out among players worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras/9d13f6c90bd5209f17c0ba120ad41b14.poster.avif?t=1776963306\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras/9d13f6c90bd5209f17c0ba120ad41b14.webm?t=1776963306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras/9d13f6c90bd5209f17c0ba120ad41b14.mp4?t=1776963306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins as a driver in the countryside. As you progress through the open world, participating in races and collecting treasures, you'll acquire a property in town, and town buildings will be at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras/687b5660c159774910d648c5645b4f1e.avif?t=1776963306\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras_big/687b5660c159774910d648c5645b4f1e.avif?t=1776963306 width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your way to becoming a speed master, develop your town, finance and technology to power-up your vehicles and get better results in events. Join online events and climb the global leaderboard to win rich and rare rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras/8a938165a168e0d758a808154e422cb8.poster.avif?t=1776963306\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras/8a938165a168e0d758a808154e422cb8.webm?t=1776963306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras/8a938165a168e0d758a808154e422cb8.mp4?t=1776963306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New buildings and upgrades unlock as you progress. Challenge other players in various races in a non-simultaneous manner to progress faster. Earning the Grandmaster merit allows you to create your own tracks and tournaments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras/e722210dafb89578e117e38437b3971d.avif?t=1776963306\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras_big/e722210dafb89578e117e38437b3971d.avif?t=1776963306 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast plains, mountains, forests, lakes and valleys, complete quests, find treasures and rare items, and participate in races to earn cash and acquire a home in your town. Build and research, develop your town by improving your finances, technology, and cars, and stand out among players worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras/9d13f6c90bd5209f17c0ba120ad41b14.poster.avif?t=1776963306\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras/9d13f6c90bd5209f17c0ba120ad41b14.webm?t=1776963306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras/9d13f6c90bd5209f17c0ba120ad41b14.mp4?t=1776963306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins as a driver in the countryside. As you progress through the open world, participating in races and collecting treasures, you'll acquire a property in town, and town buildings will be at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras/687b5660c159774910d648c5645b4f1e.avif?t=1776963306\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras_big/687b5660c159774910d648c5645b4f1e.avif?t=1776963306 width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your way to becoming a speed master, develop your town, finance and technology to power-up your vehicles and get better results in events. Join online events and climb the global leaderboard to win rich and rare rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras/8a938165a168e0d758a808154e422cb8.poster.avif?t=1776963306\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras/8a938165a168e0d758a808154e422cb8.webm?t=1776963306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras/8a938165a168e0d758a808154e422cb8.mp4?t=1776963306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New buildings and upgrades unlock as you progress. Challenge other players in various races in a non-simultaneous manner to progress faster. Earning the Grandmaster merit allows you to create your own tracks and tournaments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras/e722210dafb89578e117e38437b3971d.avif?t=1776963306\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/extras_big/e722210dafb89578e117e38437b3971d.avif?t=1776963306 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Explore a vast open world, complete quests, collect items, participate in races to earn cash, build your town, manage finances, upgrade technology, and power-up your vehicles. Challenge other players and compete in events to climb the global leaderboard.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Vietnamese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/6242d23e16b354096fb4d096a95bcbc04df9be5f/header.jpg?t=1776963306", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/bdaa19ac59f64578f38a5a3e2d6f66a9f46c89b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776963306", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374470/bdaa19ac59f64578f38a5a3e2d6f66a9f46c89b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776963306", "website": "https://teamspirit.games", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel® Core™ I5-8400 @ 2.5 GHz / 